SUMMARY:A Benefit Concert with Oscar Rossignoli
DESCRIPTION:Turn your Saturday into a night to remember! Join us on September 9th at 8 PM for an unforgetable evening of music with New Orleans own the Oscar Rossignoli Trio! Proceeds from this concert will directly help Global Healing‘s ongoing efforts in Roatán\, Honduras\, continuing to support fire recovery and providing the assistance needed to facilitate the hospital’s pediatric and maternal services. Helping to collaboratively care for expectant mother’s and children. \nIn 2024\, a shocking fire ravaged the sole public hospital on Roatán. Home to Global Healing’s pediatric clinic and hosptal services for over the past two decades\, the hospital was vital for emergency care for both children and adults\, performing urgent surgeries\, and providing maternity services—like life-saving C-sections. Reduced to ashes\, the hospital and clinic left Honduras with even fewer means to deliver essential medical care. All medical equipment was lost\, and recovery is still ongoing. \nEric Scher and Barbara Stowe continue to travel to Roatán often\, having helped set up a transitonal hospital in a former Adventist church\, teaching interns and fellows\, and delivering our donated and purchased medical equipment/supplies—made possible by generous supporters and benefit concert attendees like you. So come for the music (plus Barb’s famous homemade whoopie pies) and stay for the impact! Your ticket not only supports an intimate night of fantastic live music but also contributes directly to saving lives and helping the community of Roatán heal. \nAs always\, a special silent auction will be presented during the benefit—supporting Global Healing and celebrating the community members and organizations who generously donate items. If you or loved ones are interested in supporting our benefit concerts through volunteering or donating auction items for fundraising\, please contact Dr. Eric Scher at eric@globalhealing.org or (415)846-9160. \nSee you when the doors open at 7 PM! Get your Tickets here!
URL:https://www.pollyklaastheater.org/event/a-benefit-concert-with-oscar-rossignoli/
LOCATION:Polly Klaas Community Theater\, 417 Western Avenue\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952\, United States
